### Get all products
GET http://localhost:5176/api/products

### Get product by ID
GET http://localhost:5176/api/products/1

### Create a new product
POST http://localhost:5176/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Mouse",
  "description": "Ergonomic optical mouse",
  "price": 45.99,
  "stock": 15
}

### Update product
PUT http://localhost:5176/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gaming Laptop Pro",
  "description": "Updated high performance laptop",
  "price": 1350.00,
  "stock": 8
}

### Delete product
DELETE http://localhost:5176/api/products/2

### Test Validations (Error 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:5176/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": "Producto de prueba con errores",
  "price": -15.00,
  "stock": -5
}
### 1. Intentar ver productos SIN token (Debe devolver 401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:5176/api/products
Accept: application/json

### 2. Registrar un usuario administrador nuevo (Debe devolver 200 OK)
POST http://localhost:5176/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin_cristian",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Iniciar sesión para obtener el Token JWT (Copia el token de la respuesta)
POST http://localhost:5176/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin_cristian",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 4. Ver productos CON token (Reemplaza  por el texto largo del paso 3)
GET http://localhost:5176/api/products
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.._qweURC-rOPIZLn2Bx8H75-tyKFdPLbjMaq9jSIfXmY
Accept: application/json